6. How to solve array problems efficiently.

8. Conclusion

The 4Sum problem is an extension of the 3Sum problem.

- 3Sum uses one fixed number and two pointers.
- 4Sum uses two fixed numbers and two pointers.

This problem helped me understand nested loops, sorting, and the Two Pointer technique in Java.
